          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pick the clubs and national teams you care about. Matchday tracks their games, tells you which channel has them where you are, and pings you at kickoff." : {
      "comment" : "Body of the Following tab before any team is followed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wähle die Vereine und Nationalteams, die dir wichtig sind. Matchday verfolgt ihre Spiele, zeigt dir, welcher Sender sie bei dir überträgt, und meldet sich zum Anstoß."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Elige los clubes y selecciones que te importan. Matchday sigue sus partidos, te dice qué canal los emite donde estás y te avisa al comienzo."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Choisissez les clubs et sélections qui vous intéressent. Matchday suit leurs matchs, vous indique quelle chaîne les diffuse là où vous êtes et vous prévient au coup d'envoi."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Scegli i club e le nazionali che ti interessano. Matchday segue le loro partite, ti dice quale canale le trasmette dove ti trovi e ti avvisa al calcio d'inizio."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "気になるクラブや代表チームを選びましょう。Matchday が試合を追いかけ、お住まいの地域で放送するチャンネルを伝え、キックオフ時にお知らせします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "관심 있는 클럽과 국가대표팀을 선택하세요. Matchday가 경기를 추적하고, 지역에서 중계하는 채널을 알려 주며, 킥오프 때 알림을 보냅니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-PT" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Escolhe os clubes e as seleções que te interessam. O Matchday acompanha os jogos, diz-te que canal os transmite onde estás e avisa-te no início do jogo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择你关心的俱乐部和国家队。Matchday 会追踪它们的比赛，告诉你所在地区由哪个频道转播，并在开球时提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
